            ["A previous version is still installed for all users, in {0}. This version installs into your own user folder instead, so the old one is no longer used \u2014 but it stays in Settings \u2192 Apps and in the Start Menu until it's removed, where it's easy to launch by mistake."] = "Une version ant\u00E9rieure est encore install\u00E9e pour tous les utilisateurs, dans {0}. Cette version s'installe dans votre dossier utilisateur ; l'ancienne n'est plus utilis\u00E9e \u2014 mais elle reste dans Param\u00E8tres \u2192 Applications et dans le menu D\u00E9marrer jusqu'\u00E0 sa suppression, o\u00F9 il est facile de la lancer par erreur.",
            ["Removing it needs administrator rights. ClawTweaks Center never asks for those \u2014 the button below starts the old version's own uninstaller, so the prompt you see comes from it, about removing itself."] = "La suppression demande des droits administrateur. ClawTweaks Center ne les demande jamais \u2014 le bouton ci-dessous lance le d\u00E9sinstalleur de l'ancienne version ; l'invite que vous voyez vient de lui.",
            ["Scroll"] = "D\u00E9filer",
            ["These install kernel drivers. Without the restart everything looks installed and the virtual controller still won't start."] = "Ce sont des pilotes noyau. Sans red\u00E9marrage, tout semble install\u00E9 et la manette virtuelle ne d\u00E9marre toujours pas.",
            ["Version {0}"] = "Version {0}",
            ["The new ClawTweaks Center needs no administrator rights and installs to a different location."] = "Le nouveau ClawTweaks Center ne demande pas de droits administrateur et s'installe ailleurs.",
            ["No Xbox games are registered for this account."] = "Aucun jeu Xbox n'est enregistr\u00E9 pour ce compte.",
            ["No ROMs for {0}."] = "Aucune ROM pour {0}.",
            ["Cycle"] = "Changer",
            ["checking the installed version\u2026"] = "v\u00E9rification de la version install\u00E9e\u2026",
            ["you have {0}."] = "vous avez {0}.",
            ["Requires ClawTweaks {0} or newer"] = "N\u00E9cessite ClawTweaks {0} ou plus r\u00E9cent",
            ["Reset, Backup and Restore need ClawTweaks {0} (or 0.1.8+) \u2014 {1} Update ClawTweaks from \"Update & Release\" first."] = "R\u00E9initialiser, Sauvegarder et Restaurer n\u00E9cessitent ClawTweaks {0} (ou 0.1.8+) \u2014 {1} Mettez d'abord ClawTweaks \u00E0 jour depuis \u00AB Update & Release \u00BB.",
            ["Unknown error."] = "Erreur inconnue.",
            ["Restoring backup \u2014 the helper will restart when done\u2026"] = "Restauration de la sauvegarde \u2014 le helper red\u00E9marrera ensuite\u2026",
            ["Restore likely completed"] = "Restauration probablement termin\u00E9e",
            ["The helper restarted before confirming. Reopen the Game Bar (Win+G) and check your profiles \u2014 if anything looks off, restore the auto pre-restore backup."] = "Le helper a red\u00E9marr\u00E9 avant de confirmer. Rouvrez la Game Bar (Win+G) et v\u00E9rifiez vos profils \u2014 en cas de doute, restaurez la sauvegarde automatique pr\u00E9alable.",
            ["This ZIP has no valid ClawTweaks manifest \u2014 the helper will refuse it if it isn't a real backup."] = "Ce ZIP n'a pas de manifeste ClawTweaks valide \u2014 le helper le refusera si ce n'est pas une vraie sauvegarde.",
            ["Different ClawTweaks version"] = "Autre version de ClawTweaks",
            ["Supported."] = "Pris en charge.",
            ["Recognized, but not supported yet."] = "Reconnu, mais pas encore pris en charge.",
            ["Not a recognized MSI Claw \u2014 installing here is untested."] = "MSI Claw non reconnue \u2014 l'installation ici n'est pas test\u00E9e.",
            ["Install the missing prerequisites"] = "Installer les pr\u00E9requis manquants",
            ["Download each one from the vendor and run their installer, then re-check."] = "T\u00E9l\u00E9chargez chacun chez l'\u00E9diteur, lancez son installateur, puis rev\u00E9rifiez.",
            ["Re-check and continue"] = "Rev\u00E9rifier et continuer",
            ["Re-check tools"] = "Rev\u00E9rifier les outils",
            ["Trust the ClawTweaks signing certificate"] = "Faire confiance au certificat de signature ClawTweaks",
            ["ClawTweaks is signed with its own certificate, and Windows only installs a package whose certificate it trusts. You only have to do this once \u2014 every future build uses the same one."] = "ClawTweaks est sign\u00E9 avec son propre certificat, et Windows n'installe qu'un paquet dont il approuve le certificat. \u00C0 faire une seule fois \u2014 chaque build futur utilise le m\u00EAme.",
            ["The certificate was imported for your user account instead of the local machine. Windows only consults the machine store when installing a package, so this has no effect. Run the import again and pick \"Local Machine\" on the first page."] = "Le certificat a \u00E9t\u00E9 import\u00E9 pour votre compte utilisateur au lieu de l'ordinateur local. Windows ne consulte que le magasin de l'ordinateur pour installer un paquet, donc cela n'a aucun effet. Relancez l'importation et choisissez \u00AB Ordinateur local \u00BB sur la premi\u00E8re page.",
            ["The certificate landed in \"Trusted Root Certification Authorities\". That is both more than ClawTweaks needs \u2014 it would make this certificate a trust anchor for anything, not just this package \u2014 and still not where Windows looks. Remove it from there and import it into \"Trusted People\" instead."] = "Le certificat s'est retrouv\u00E9 dans \u00AB Autorit\u00E9s de certification racines de confiance \u00BB. C'est \u00E0 la fois plus que ce dont ClawTweaks a besoin \u2014 il deviendrait une ancre de confiance pour tout, pas seulement ce paquet \u2014 et toujours pas l\u00E0 o\u00F9 Windows regarde. Retirez-le de l\u00E0 et importez-le plut\u00F4t dans \u00AB Personnes autoris\u00E9es \u00BB.",
            ["Check the certificate and continue"] = "V\u00E9rifier le certificat et continuer",
            ["Check certificate"] = "V\u00E9rifier le certificat",
            ["Installed, but the helper did not appear in time \u2014 open the Game Bar (Win+G) manually."] = "Install\u00E9, mais le helper n'est pas apparu \u00E0 temps \u2014 ouvrez la Game Bar (Win+G) manuellement.",
            ["Virtual pad"] = "Manette virtuelle",
            ["Virtual controller mode detected"] = "Mode manette virtuelle d\u00E9tect\u00E9",
            ["{0} active and running."] = "{0} actif et en marche.",
            ["HW controller mode detected"] = "Mode manette mat\u00E9rielle d\u00E9tect\u00E9",
            ["MSI HW Controller active and running."] = "Manette mat\u00E9rielle MSI active et en marche.",
            ["Claw controller not detected."] = "Manette Claw non d\u00E9tect\u00E9e.",
            ["Controller mode unknown"] = "Mode manette inconnu",
            ["The download did not complete. Check your internet connection and try again."] = "Le t\u00E9l\u00E9chargement ne s'est pas termin\u00E9. V\u00E9rifiez votre connexion Internet et r\u00E9essayez.",
            ["This version has no package to download."] = "Cette version n'a aucun paquet \u00E0 t\u00E9l\u00E9charger.",
            ["Download complete."] = "T\u00E9l\u00E9chargement termin\u00E9.",
            ["The download contains no package file."] = "Le t\u00E9l\u00E9chargement ne contient aucun fichier de paquet.",
            ["The downloaded package is incomplete \u2014 its manifest is missing."] = "Le paquet t\u00E9l\u00E9charg\u00E9 est incomplet \u2014 son manifeste manque.",
            ["The downloaded package is not readable."] = "Le paquet t\u00E9l\u00E9charg\u00E9 est illisible.",
            ["(received {0:N0} of {1:N0} bytes)"] = "({0:N0} octets re\u00E7us sur {1:N0})",
            ["The download produced an empty file."] = "Le t\u00E9l\u00E9chargement a produit un fichier vide.",
            ["Click \"Install Certificate\u2026\" on the General tab."] = "Cliquez sur \u00AB Installer un certificat\u2026 \u00BB dans l'onglet G\u00E9n\u00E9ral.",
            ["Store Location: choose \"Local Machine\" (not \"Current User\"), then Next. Windows asks for administrator rights here \u2014 that prompt comes from Windows itself."] = "Emplacement du magasin : choisissez \u00AB Ordinateur local \u00BB (pas \u00AB Utilisateur actuel \u00BB), puis Suivant. Windows demande ici des droits d'administrateur \u2014 cette invite vient de Windows lui-m\u00EAme.",
            ["Choose \"Place all certificates in the following store\", click Browse\u2026"] = "Choisissez \u00AB Placer tous les certificats dans le magasin suivant \u00BB, cliquez sur Parcourir\u2026",
            ["Select \"Trusted People\" \u2014 NOT \"Trusted Root Certification Authorities\"."] = "S\u00E9lectionnez \u00AB Personnes autoris\u00E9es \u00BB \u2014 PAS \u00AB Autorit\u00E9s de certification racines de confiance \u00BB.",
            ["Next, then Finish. You should see \"The import was successful.\""] = "Suivant, puis Terminer. Vous devriez voir \u00AB L'importation a r\u00E9ussi. \u00BB",
            ["Controller probe timed out."] = "Test de la manette expir\u00E9.",
            ["Controller probe failed: {0}"] = "Test de la manette \u00E9chou\u00E9 : {0}",
            ["MSI Claw controller not detected (VID_0DB0). Connect/enable the controller, or MSI Center M may have taken it over."] = "Manette MSI Claw non d\u00E9tect\u00E9e (VID_0DB0). Connectez/activez la manette, ou MSI Center M l'a peut-\u00EAtre prise en main.",
            ["MSI Center M is running. It can fight ClawTweaks for the controller and LED. This is handled after installation."] = "MSI Center M est en cours d'ex\u00E9cution. Il peut disputer la manette et la LED \u00E0 ClawTweaks. Cela est r\u00E9gl\u00E9 apr\u00E8s l'installation.",
            ["Steam's Xbox controller filter driver is present \u2014 a common cause of double input. Check Steam Input settings if you see doubled inputs."] = "Le pilote de filtre de manette Xbox de Steam est pr\u00E9sent \u2014 cause fr\u00E9quente de double saisie. V\u00E9rifiez les r\u00E9glages Steam Input si les entr\u00E9es sont doubl\u00E9es.",
            ["{0} XInput controllers are currently visible. Two or more while playing = double input."] = "{0} manettes XInput sont visibles actuellement. Deux ou plus en jeu = double saisie.",
            ["Controller healthy \u2014 ready to mount as a virtual pad."] = "Manette en bon \u00E9tat \u2014 pr\u00EAte \u00E0 \u00EAtre mont\u00E9e en manette virtuelle.",
            ["MSI Claw controller not found. Connect/enable it (MSI Center M may hold it)."] = "Manette MSI Claw introuvable. Connectez-la/activez-la (MSI Center M la retient peut-\u00EAtre).",
            ["Controller HID is held by another process \u2014 close conflicting controller software and re-check."] = "Le HID de la manette est retenu par un autre processus \u2014 fermez les logiciels de manette en conflit et rev\u00E9rifiez.",
            ["Controller HID opened but did not respond \u2014 try re-checking; a reboot may be needed."] = "HID de la manette ouvert mais sans r\u00E9ponse \u2014 rev\u00E9rifiez ; un red\u00E9marrage peut \u00EAtre n\u00E9cessaire.",
            ["Could not determine controller health."] = "Impossible de d\u00E9terminer l'\u00E9tat de la manette.",
            ["The helper did not answer the health probe."] = "Le helper n'a pas r\u00E9pondu au test d'\u00E9tat.",
            ["Unknown device"] = "Appareil inconnu",
            ["Could not locate the installed package \u2014 helper files not deployed."] = "Paquet install\u00E9 introuvable \u2014 fichiers du helper non d\u00E9ploy\u00E9s.",
            ["Helper files were not deployed \u2014 the widget will retry when it starts the helper."] = "Fichiers du helper non d\u00E9ploy\u00E9s \u2014 le widget r\u00E9essaiera au d\u00E9marrage du helper.",
            ["The helper is not answering."] = "Le helper ne r\u00E9pond pas.",
            ["A backup of your settings is at {0}"] = "Une sauvegarde de vos r\u00E9glages se trouve dans {0}",
            ["Could not connect to the helper."] = "Connexion au helper impossible.",
            ["The helper did not respond in time."] = "Le helper n'a pas r\u00E9pondu \u00E0 temps.",
            ["Disabling\u2026"] = "D\u00E9sactivation\u2026",
            ["Disabled."] = "D\u00E9sactiv\u00E9.",
            ["Enabling\u2026"] = "Activation\u2026",
            ["Enabled and verified ({0})."] = "Activ\u00E9 et v\u00E9rifi\u00E9 ({0}).",
            ["virtual pad"] = "manette virtuelle",
            ["Hides the physical gamepad so games see only the virtual controller."] = "Masque la manette physique pour que les jeux ne voient que la manette virtuelle.",
            ["Take HidHide_x.x.x.x_x64.exe."] = "Prenez HidHide_x.x.x.x_x64.exe.",
            ["Provides the virtual controller itself (the VIIPER backend)."] = "Fournit la manette virtuelle elle-m\u00EAme (le backend VIIPER).",
            ["Take USBip-0.9.8.0-x64.exe from this page. The link opens version 0.9.8.0 deliberately \u2014 it is the version ClawTweaks supports."] = "Prenez USBip-0.9.8.0-x64.exe sur cette page. Le lien ouvre volontairement la version 0.9.8.0 \u2014 c'est celle que ClawTweaks prend en charge.",
            ["Do not download the ARM version, and do not take an older usbip release: below 0.9.8.0 the device blue-screens while the virtual controller runs."] = "Ne t\u00E9l\u00E9chargez pas la version ARM ni une version usbip plus ancienne : sous 0.9.8.0 l'appareil plante en \u00E9cran bleu d\u00E8s que la manette virtuelle tourne.",
            ["Applies the per-game FPS cap and draws the on-screen display."] = "Applique la limite de FPS par jeu et dessine l'affichage \u00E0 l'\u00E9cran.",
            ["Take RivaTuner Statistics Server."] = "Prenez RivaTuner Statistics Server.",
            ["Reads the CPU sensors ClawTweaks shows in the widget."] = "Lit les capteurs CPU que ClawTweaks affiche dans le widget.",
            ["Take PawnIO Setup."] = "Prenez PawnIO Setup.",
            ["This ClawTweaks Center build is outdated. Please download the latest build."] = "Cette version de ClawTweaks Center est obsol\u00E8te. T\u00E9l\u00E9chargez la derni\u00E8re version.",
            ["{0} (running {1}, needs {2}+)"] = "{0} (en cours {1}, requis {2}+)",
            ["Test build"] = "Build de test",
            ["Release"] = "Version",
            ["BROKEN: leftover registry entries but no driver binary \u2014 reinstall and reboot"] = "CASS\u00C9 : restes de registre sans binaire de pilote \u2014 r\u00E9installez et red\u00E9marrez",
            ["BROKEN: usbip's files are installed but its driver is not registered \u2014 the installer's driver step (devnode.exe) failed. The usual cause is the -arm64 download, which the release page lists above the x64 one. Uninstall usbip, re-run the installer whose name ends in -x64.exe, and reboot."] = "CASS\u00C9 : les fichiers d'usbip sont install\u00E9s mais son pilote n'est pas enregistr\u00E9 \u2014 l'\u00E9tape pilote de l'installateur (devnode.exe) a \u00E9chou\u00E9. La cause habituelle est le t\u00E9l\u00E9chargement -arm64, list\u00E9 au-dessus du x64 sur la page de release. D\u00E9sinstallez usbip, relancez l'installateur dont le nom finit par -x64.exe, puis red\u00E9marrez.",
            ["UNSUPPORTED VERSION: usbip {0} is installed, ClawTweaks needs {1}. Older versions crash the device with a blue screen while the virtual controller is running, so ClawTweaks will not start it. Run the ClawTweaks setup, or install {1} from the link on this page, and reboot."] = "VERSION NON PRISE EN CHARGE : usbip {0} est install\u00E9, ClawTweaks a besoin de {1}. Les versions plus anciennes plantent l'appareil en \u00E9cran bleu pendant que la manette virtuelle tourne, donc ClawTweaks ne la d\u00E9marre pas. Lancez l'installation ClawTweaks, ou installez {1} via le lien sur cette page, puis red\u00E9marrez.",
            ["UNSUPPORTED VERSION: usbip {0} is installed, ClawTweaks needs {1}. Uninstall usbip, install {1} from the link on this page, and reboot."] = "VERSION NON PRISE EN CHARGE : usbip {0} est install\u00E9, ClawTweaks a besoin de {1}. D\u00E9sinstallez usbip, installez {1} via le lien sur cette page, puis red\u00E9marrez.",
