            ["Wipe every ClawTweaks setting back to a clean state (all profiles, fan curves, TDP, controller). This cannot be undone \u2014 take a backup first if unsure."] = "Restablece todos los ajustes de ClawTweaks (perfiles, ventiladores, TDP, mando). No se puede deshacer \u2014 haz una copia antes si dudas.",
