            ["Not a recognized MSI Claw \u2014 installing here is untested."] = "No es una MSI Claw reconocida \u2014 instalar aqu\u00ED no est\u00E1 probado.",
            ["Install the missing prerequisites"] = "Instalar los requisitos que faltan",
            ["Download each one from the vendor and run their installer, then re-check."] = "Descarga cada uno del fabricante, ejecuta su instalador y vuelve a comprobar.",
            ["Re-check and continue"] = "Volver a comprobar y continuar",
            ["Re-check tools"] = "Recomprobar",
            ["Trust the ClawTweaks signing certificate"] = "Confiar en el certificado de firma de ClawTweaks",
            ["ClawTweaks is signed with its own certificate, and Windows only installs a package whose certificate it trusts. You only have to do this once \u2014 every future build uses the same one."] = "ClawTweaks est\u00E1 firmado con su propio certificado y Windows solo instala paquetes cuyo certificado conf\u00EDa. Solo hay que hacerlo una vez \u2014 cada build futuro usa el mismo.",
            ["The certificate was imported for your user account instead of the local machine. Windows only consults the machine store when installing a package, so this has no effect. Run the import again and pick \"Local Machine\" on the first page."] = "El certificado se import\u00F3 para tu cuenta de usuario en vez de para el equipo local. Windows solo consulta el almac\u00E9n del equipo al instalar un paquete, as\u00ED que no tiene efecto. Repite la importaci\u00F3n y elige \"Equipo local\" en la primera p\u00E1gina.",
